=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Veit (A)} at (H-4). He is northeast of Conflux #5.
* He will request a {@i:Powder Casket|2954} {i:Powder Casket|Powder Casket|2954}. These can be obtained by defeating {m:Brine Crab}, which are fished up in the nearby stream.
** To fish up the {m:Brine Crab} almost any pole/bait combination works. The crabs will have the "ferociously bites" message.
** The drop rate is **{p:U|Uncommon (10%)}** from the brine crab. {p:Treasure Hunter} is strongly encouraged.
* After obtaining the {@i:Powder Casket|2954} {i:Powder Casket|Powder Casket|2954}, trade it back to {p:Veit (A)}.
* There is a chance he will not accept the casket because it has "moisture" inside. You will have to obtain another casket.
* After you trade an acceptable casket, you will complete the quest.

* The {i:Versa Breeches|Versa Breeches|11930} will have a random {@g:Augment} on them.

__Zoning **is** required to repeat this quest.__
